-- src:1301 | Where, in the course of that evaluation, the market surveillance authority or, where applicable the market surveillance authority in cooperation with the national public authority referred to in Article 77(1), finds that the AI system does not comply with the requirements and obligations laid down in this Regulation, it shall without undue delay require the relevant operator to take all appropriate corrective actions to bring the AI system into compliance, to withdraw the AI system from the market, or to recall it within a period the market surveillance authority may prescribe, and in any event within the shorter of 15 working days, or as provided for in the relevant Union harmonisation legislation.
@ref Art 79(2) second subparagraph (src:1301)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the number of days that the 15 working days cover` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of days that the relevant Union harmonisation legislation provides` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `the number of days that the market surveillance authority prescribes` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`Art 79(2) second subparagraph the number of days within which the operator must take the corrective action` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives, and Art 111(2) saves a high-risk AI system placed earlier and not significantly changed
    ELSE JUST (`the least of` (`the least of` `the number of days that the 15 working days cover` (`the days or else the working days` `the number of days that the relevant Union harmonisation legislation provides` `the number of days that the 15 working days cover`)) (`the days or else the working days` `the number of days that the market surveillance authority prescribes` `the number of days that the 15 working days cover`))  -- "within a period the market surveillance authority may prescribe, and in any event within the shorter of 15 working days, or as provided for in the relevant Union harmonisation legislation": the least of the periods that apply
        WHERE
            GIVEN `the first` IS A NUMBER
                  `the second` IS A NUMBER
            GIVETH A NUMBER
            `the least of` MEANS IF `the first` AT MOST `the second` THEN `the first` ELSE `the second`
            GIVEN `the maybe days` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
                  `the fallback` IS A NUMBER
            GIVETH A NUMBER
            `the days or else the working days` MEANS
                CONSIDER `the maybe days`
                WHEN NOTHING THEN `the fallback`
                WHEN JUST `the days` THEN `the days`

-- src:1301 | Where, in the course of that evaluation, the market surveillance authority or, where applicable the market surveillance authority in cooperation with the national public authority referred to in Article 77(1), finds that the AI system does not comply with the requirements and obligations laid down in this Regulation, it shall without undue delay require the relevant operator to take all appropriate corrective actions to bring the AI system into compliance, to withdraw the AI system from the market, or to recall it within a period the market surveillance authority may prescribe, and in any event within the shorter of 15 working days, or as provided for in the relevant Union harmonisation legislation.
@ref Art 79(2) second subparagraph (src:1301)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the number of days that the 15 working days cover` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of days that the relevant Union harmonisation legislation provides` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `the number of days that the market surveillance authority prescribes` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 79 act`
`Art 79(2) second subparagraph the operator's duty to take all appropriate corrective actions within the period` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Art 79(2) second subparagraph the number of days within which the operator must take the corrective action` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the number of days that the 15 working days cover` `the number of days that the relevant Union harmonisation legislation provides` `the number of days that the market surveillance authority prescribes`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the group General does not apply on the date asked, or the system is saved by Art 111(2)
    WHEN JUST `the days` THEN
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party operator`
        MUST `Art 79(2) take all appropriate corrective actions within the period`
        WITHIN `the days`
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST BREACH BY `Arts 72 to 79 party operator` BECAUSE "the operator did not take adequate corrective action within the period referred to in Article 79(2), so that Article 79(5) requires provisional measures"

-- src:1302 | The market surveillance authority shall inform the relevant notified body accordingly. Article 18 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 shall apply to the measures referred to in the second subparagraph of this paragraph.
@ref Art 79(2) third subparagraph, first sentence (src:1302)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the market surveillance authority has required the operator to take corrective actions under the second subparagraph` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 79(2) third subparagraph first sentence the market surveillance authority must inform the relevant notified body` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives, and Art 111(2) saves a high-risk AI system placed earlier and not significantly changed
    ELSE IF `the market surveillance authority has required the operator to take corrective actions under the second subparagraph`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the sentence is about the market surveillance authority's requirement of the second subparagraph

