`Art 79(7) the other market surveillance authority's duty to inform the Commission and the other Member States of any measures adopted` MEANS
    IF (NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)) OR (NOT `the market surveillance authority is other than the market surveillance authority of the Member State initiating the procedure`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the group General does not apply on the date asked, the system is saved by Art 111(2), or the conditions of the duty are not met
    ELSE
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party market surveillance authority`
        MUST `Art 79(7) inform the Commission and the other Member States of any measures adopted and of any additional information at their disposal relating to the non-compliance`
        HENCE FULFILLED

-- src:1311 | 7. The market surveillance authorities other than the market surveillance authority of the Member State initiating the procedure shall, without undue delay, inform the Commission and the other Member States of any measures adopted and of any additional information at their disposal relating to the non-compliance of the AI system concerned, and, in the event of disagreement with the notified national measure, of their objections.
@ref Art 79(7) second limb (src:1311)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the market surveillance authority is other than the market surveillance authority of the Member State initiating the procedure` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the market surveillance authority disagrees with the notified national measure` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 79(7) the market surveillance authority must inform the Commission and the other Member States of its objections` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives, and Art 111(2) saves a high-risk AI system placed earlier and not significantly changed
    ELSE IF `the market surveillance authority is other than the market surveillance authority of the Member State initiating the procedure` AND `the market surveillance authority disagrees with the notified national measure`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "and, in the event of disagreement with the notified national measure, of their objections" (an unmet "in the event of" gate counts as the text's no: ruling (b)) (fork F-79-7-duty)

-- src:1311 | 7. The market surveillance authorities other than the market surveillance authority of the Member State initiating the procedure shall, without undue delay, inform the Commission and the other Member States of any measures adopted and of any additional information at their disposal relating to the non-compliance of the AI system concerned, and, in the event of disagreement with the notified national measure, of their objections.
@ref Art 79(7) second limb (src:1311)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the market surveillance authority is other than the market surveillance authority of the Member State initiating the procedure` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the market surveillance authority disagrees with the notified national measure` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 79 act`
`Art 79(7) the other market surveillance authority's duty to inform the Commission and the other Member States of its objections` MEANS
    IF (NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)) OR (NOT `the market surveillance authority is other than the market surveillance authority of the Member State initiating the procedure`) OR (NOT `the market surveillance authority disagrees with the notified national measure`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the group General does not apply on the date asked, the system is saved by Art 111(2), or the conditions of the duty are not met
    ELSE
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party market surveillance authority`
        MUST `Art 79(7) inform the Commission and the other Member States of their objections to the notified national measure`
        HENCE FULFILLED

-- Paragraph 8: the period for objections is three months from receipt of the notification, 30 days for non-compliance with the prohibition of the AI practices referred to in Article 5.
-- src:1312 | 8. Where, within three months of receipt of the notification referred to in paragraph 5 of this Article, no objection has been raised by either a market surveillance authority of a Member State or by the Commission in respect of a provisional measure taken by a market surveillance authority of another Member State, that measure shall be deemed justified. This shall be without prejudice to the procedural rights of the concerned operator in accordance with Article 18 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020. The three-month period referred to in this paragraph shall be reduced to 30 days in the event of non-compliance with the prohibition of the AI practices referred to in Article 5 of this Regulation.
@ref Art 79(8) first and third sentences (src:1312)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date the notification referred to in paragraph 5 is received` IS A DATE
      `the non-compliance is non-compliance with the prohibition of the AI practices referred to in Article 5` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`Art 79(8) the last day on which an objection to the provisional measure may be raised` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives, and Art 111(2) saves a high-risk AI system placed earlier and not significantly changed
    ELSE IF `the non-compliance is non-compliance with the prohibition of the AI practices referred to in Article 5`
         THEN JUST (`the date the notification referred to in paragraph 5 is received` PLUS 30)  -- "The three-month period referred to in this paragraph shall be reduced to 30 days in the event of non-compliance with the prohibition of the AI practices referred to in Article 5"
         ELSE JUST (`add months` `the date the notification referred to in paragraph 5 is received` 3)  -- "within three months of receipt of the notification referred to in paragraph 5"

-- src:1312 | 8. Where, within three months of receipt of the notification referred to in paragraph 5 of this Article, no objection has been raised by either a market surveillance authority of a Member State or by the Commission in respect of a provisional measure taken by a market surveillance authority of another Member State, that measure shall be deemed justified. This shall be without prejudice to the procedural rights of the concerned operator in accordance with Article 18 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020. The three-month period referred to in this paragraph shall be reduced to 30 days in the event of non-compliance with the prohibition of the AI practices referred to in Article 5 of this Regulation.
@ref Art 79(8) first sentence (src:1312)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date the notification referred to in paragraph 5 is received` IS A DATE
      `the non-compliance is non-compliance with the prohibition of the AI practices referred to in Article 5` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provisional measure was taken by a market surveillance authority of another Member State` IS A BOOLEAN
      `no objection has been raised within the period by either a market surveillance authority of a Member State or by the Commission` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 79(8) the provisional measure is deemed justified` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Art 79(8) the last day on which an objection to the provisional measure may be raised` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the date the notification referred to in paragraph 5 is received` `the non-compliance is non-compliance with the prohibition of the AI practices referred to in Article 5`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): no period arises on these facts (see the function above)
    WHEN JUST `the last day` THEN
        IF     `the provisional measure was taken by a market surveillance authority of another Member State`
           AND `no objection has been raised within the period by either a market surveillance authority of a Member State or by the Commission`
           AND `the date asked` GREATER THAN `the last day`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where, within three months of receipt of the notification referred to in paragraph 5, no objection has been raised ... in respect of a provisional measure taken by a market surveillance authority of another Member State, that measure shall be deemed justified" (an unmet "where" gate counts as the text's no: ruling (b); the period has not run, or an objection was raised, or the measure is the authority's own)

-- src:1312 | 8. Where, within three months of receipt of the notification referred to in paragraph 5 of this Article, no objection has been raised by either a market surveillance authority of a Member State or by the Commission in respect of a provisional measure taken by a market surveillance authority of another Member State, that measure shall be deemed justified. This shall be without prejudice to the procedural rights of the concerned operator in accordance with Article 18 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020. The three-month period referred to in this paragraph shall be reduced to 30 days in the event of non-compliance with the prohibition of the AI practices referred to in Article 5 of this Regulation.
@ref Art 79(8) second sentence (src:1312)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the operator has procedural rights in accordance with Article 18 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 79(8) second sentence the deeming is without prejudice to the procedural rights of the concerned operator in accordance with Article 18 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives, and Art 111(2) saves a high-risk AI system placed earlier and not significantly changed
    ELSE IF `the operator has procedural rights in accordance with Article 18 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the sentence is about "the procedural rights of the concerned operator in accordance with Article 18"

-- src:1313 | 9. The market surveillance authorities shall ensure that appropriate restrictive measures are taken in respect of the product or the AI system concerned, such as withdrawal of the product or the AI system from their market, without undue delay.
