    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives, and Art 111(2) saves a high-risk AI system placed earlier and not significantly changed
    ELSE IF `restrictive measures are appropriate in respect of the product or the AI system concerned`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the sentence is about "appropriate restrictive measures ... in respect of the product or the AI system concerned"

